&lt;li&gt;Build, refine, and optimize dashboards, searches, and correlations for proactive detection of anomalies and performance degradation;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve alerts and monitoring indicators, reducing false positives and increasing monitoring accuracy;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze logs, metrics, and events to identify root causes and support incident response;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on data ingestion, structuring, and standardization (logs and events) to ensure data quality and reliable analysis;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to automation and continuous improvements to reduce manual effort and increase operational efficiency;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the evolution of the observability strategy, expanding monitoring coverage and depth;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with technical teams to define instrumentation standards and observability best practices;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure new products, flows, and go-lives are properly monitored from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
