&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;若職缺已招滿，該職缺可能提前關閉&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;若發現應徵者提供不實資訊，公司有權撤回錄取通知&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;符合就業保障身份者（如退伍軍人、身心障礙者等），將依相關法規優先考量&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;隱私權聲明（&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;）&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;您的個人資料將依 Coupang 隱私政策進行蒐集與管理：&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Overseas” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coupang’s recruiters and branding specialists play a critical role in driving our phenomenal growth by identifying and hiring top talent. As an Employer Branding Senior Specialist, you will lead our strategic efforts to shape how the world perceives Coupang. You will act as a strategic partner to the RFC recruiting team, functioning as an ambassador who champions Coupang’s leadership principles and corporate culture through creative storytelling and impactful brand identity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive&lt;/strong&gt; integrated recruitment marketing strategies across online and offline channels (e.g., job boards, social media, campus events, and career fairs) to build a robust talent pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage&lt;/strong&gt; and optimize various recruitment channels by analyzing conversion rates and candidate quality to maximize sourcing efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promote&lt;/strong&gt; the Employee Value Proposition (EVP) across internal and external communication platforms, ensuring the Coupang story resonates with diverse talent pools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop&lt;/strong&gt; high-impact recruitment content and campaigns, tailoring messaging for different platforms to enhance brand engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitor&lt;/strong&gt; the end-to-end candidate journey and brand perception, using feedback to identify bottlenecks and improve the overall candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute&lt;/strong&gt; data-driven analysis of branding initiatives, tracking key metrics (e.g., Cost-per-Hire, Channel ROI, Engagement) to provide actionable insights for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate&lt;/strong&gt; closely with recruiters and hiring managers to understand specific hiring needs and translate them into effective branding activations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree and 5+ years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;Employer Branding, Recruitment Marketing, or Performance Marketing&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong focus on talent acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing &lt;strong&gt;multi-channel marketing campaigns (Online &amp;amp; Offline)&lt;/strong&gt; and understanding recruitment funnels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to solve problems through creative thinking and cross-functional partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to attain challenging targets through goal-setting and personal drive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in digital content strategy and social media analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong data literacy&lt;/strong&gt; with experience in using analytics tools to measure marketing ROI and recruitment effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General understanding of business operations across key areas such as finance/legal/HR/logistics/e-commerce/tech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working or hiring within a high-growth start-up or fast-paced tech environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process and Others&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Review - Phone Interview - Onsite (or Virtual Onsite) Interview – Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
