&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pure Storage is seeking a dynamic and results-oriented &lt;strong&gt;Director, Partner Sales ANZ &lt;/strong&gt;to lead and scale our ANZ partner ecosystem. This is a high-impact leadership role responsible for driving strategic growth through a team of Partner Account Managers, strengthening executive-level partner relationships, and maximizing revenue through a high-performing channel strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key member of the sales leadership team, you will play a critical role in shaping go-to-market success by aligning closely with Regional Sales leadership, Field Marketing, and cross-functional teams. You will champion a partner-first approach—unlocking new opportunities, accelerating pipeline creation, and expanding Pure Storage’s footprint through best-in-class channel execution.&lt;/p&gt;
