&lt;li&gt;Identify, recruit, and grow strategic reseller and distribution partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute joint business plans with key partners to accelerate sell-through and long-term growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen Executive Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain senior-level relationships with key partners, acting as a trusted advisor and strategic counterpart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex contract negotiations and partnership agreements aligned with mutual business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate Pure Storage’s value proposition within the partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with &lt;strong&gt;ANZ Sales leadership, District Managers, and Account Executives&lt;/strong&gt; to align on territory plans and drive joint success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with &lt;strong&gt;Partner and Field Marketing&lt;/strong&gt; to design and execute high-impact programs, campaigns, and events that generate demand and expand reach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively represent Pure Storage at industry events, partner engagements, and executive forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Market Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
