&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with 3rd parties to fulfil contract compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Able to upselling once understand client&#39;s expectation and see business area to grow up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Must Have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
